        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 1 · Five-Ring Issue Map and Proof Thesis\n## 0:00–4:19\n\nLionel opens as teacher rather than merely commentator. He separates five related analytical rings and says the criminal trial addresses only one of them. \n\nHe then states the day's legal thesis in compressed form: `No gun, not guilty`, arguing that the prosecution must establish the relationship between the alleged rifle and the fatal shot. \n\n**Existing moves:** `Defines Standard`, `States Thesis`, `Separates Questions`.\n\n**New refinement:** explicit `Issue Scope Map`."
        }
      }
    },
