        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 2 · Thematic Prepper Sponsor\n## 4:19–5:59\n\nLionel briefly widens from the trial to a claim that the world is coming apart, mentions emergency food, supplies, and generators, and flows directly into the My Patriot Supply advertisement. \n\n**Production grammar:** another clear `thematic sponsor transition`."
        }
      }
    },
