        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 10 · Month-End Community Close\n## 1:21:10–1:22:57\n\nLionel notes the end of July and his approaching birthday, thanks viewers for their kindness, praise, presence, contributions, interest, and commitment to truth, then asks for likes, subscriptions, and notifications before the recurring signoff. \n\n**Existing production grammar:** audience-to-community conversion plus ritual outro."
        }
      }
    },
