        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 🧬 Observed Grammar\n\n**define issue scopes -> isolate prosecution question -> state proof thesis -> thematic sponsor -> open world-order branch -> return to trial -> teach issue analysis -> audit proof chain -> classify irrelevant evidence -> open AI and cultural branches -> return to order thread -> model breakdown scenario -> poll political confidence -> construct alternative coalition -> return to AI through writing -> community close**\n\n## Episode family\n`Lionel Live Monologue`\n\n## Sequence controller\n`live-thematic-thread`\n\n## Navigation mode\n`branch-and-return`\n\n## Navigation state\n`threadSet`\n\nThe episode does not require a new composition family."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study10-issuescope",
