          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 🎯 New Shared Primitive · Issue Scope\n\nThe opening `rings` reveal an analytical object that is not the same thing as a Topic Thread.\n\n## Topic Thread\nTracks **where the conversation currently is**.\n\n## Issue Scope\nTracks **which question a claim or evidence item is relevant to**.\n\nFor the Charlie Kirk material Lionel distinguishes, among others:\n\n- who committed the killing\n- whether Tyler Robinson can be convicted\n- TPUSA and Erica\n- why Candace is being attacked\n\nAn item can therefore be:\n\n`interesting = true`\n\nwhile also being:\n\n`relevantTo(prosecution) = false`\n\nPossible fields:\n\n- `question`\n- `scope`\n- `standard`\n- `burden`\n- `includedClaims`\n- `excludedClaims`\n\nPossible relationships:\n\n- `relevantTo`\n- `irrelevantTo`\n- `answers`\n- `doesNotAnswer`\n- `belongsToIssue`\n\nThis looks useful well beyond Lionel."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study10-issueanalysis",
