        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# ✅ Held-Out Validation Result\n\nThe hostile rule was: **do not create a new class or family merely because the subject changes.**\n\nStudy 10 passes that test well.\n\n## Existing machinery explains almost everything\n- Lionel Live Monologue\n- branch-and-return\n- thread set\n- sponsor bridge\n- evidence audit\n- proof test\n- analogy\n- scenario simulation\n- autobiographical context\n- audience input\n- actor-field mapping\n- coalition mapping\n- community close\n\n## Genuine refinement\nThe transcript makes **issue scope and relevance sorting** explicit enough that they deserve first-class representation.\n\n## No new episode family required\nThe content is extraordinarily broad. The grammar is not."
        }
      }
    },
