          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 🔬 Comparison Across Ten Studies\n\n## 01\nThesis-controlled monologue.\n\n## 02\nHosted evidence audit.\n\n## 03\nSource-timeline media reaction.\n\n## 04\nOpponent-argument audit with source exhibits.\n\n## 05\nMedia-queue roundup.\n\n## 06\nLive thematic thread with branch-and-return.\n\n## 07\nThesis monologue with scenario simulation.\n\n## 08\nLayered live monologue with several persistent storylines.\n\n## 09\nLive but mostly-linear thesis monologue with evidence bundle.\n\n## 10\nBranch-and-return live monologue with explicit **issue-scope sorting** inside the threads.\n\n## Convergence result\nStudies 07 through 10 have not required a new composition family.\n\nInstead they have:\n\n- confirmed existing families\n- cross-combined established dimensions\n- compressed rhetorical moves\n- refined state and analytical primitives\n\nThat is strong evidence that the discovery phase is reaching saturation."
        }
      }
    },
