        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# 🗜️ Current Compressed Grammar After Ten Studies\n\n## Container\n- recorded Lionel-owned\n- live Lionel-owned\n- guest appearance inside another host's container\n\n## Sequence controller\n- thesis\n- evidence audit\n- host interaction\n- source timeline\n- opponent argument\n- media queue\n- live thematic thread\n\n## Navigation mode\n- mostly-linear\n- serial\n- source-bound\n- queue-driven\n- branch-and-return\n\n## Navigation primitives\n- thread set\n- active thread\n- suspended thread\n- branch\n- return point\n- queue item\n- continuation state\n\n## Analytical primitives\n- issue scope\n- claim\n- standard\n- evidence item\n- evidence bundle\n- hypothesis\n- relevance relation\n- actor field\n- coalition\n- research funnel\n\n## Stable Lionel operations\n- frame\n- state thesis\n- perform issue analysis\n- define standard\n- audit evidence\n- analogize\n- simulate scenario\n- add context\n- model another perspective\n- map actors\n- comment on media\n- synthesize\n- qualify uncertainty\n- personalize stakes\n- incorporate audience\n\nThe corpus is now compressing faster than it expands."
        }
      }
    },
